docs {
# Health Check
Returns the current health status and server timestamp.

## Usage
Public health monitoring endpoint for load balancers and uptime checks.

## Response Example
```json
{
  "status": "ok",
  "timestamp": "2026-07-30T15:00:00.000Z"
}
```
}
